  {
   "id": "6a10aa042b96f93652e3ff84",
   "title": "Amendola Vs. Blades",
   "startDate": 1783038600666,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/7/2/amendola-vs-blades",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Longtime musical associates Scott Amendola and Wil Blades have been playing as a duo for over 20 years as \"Amendola Vs. Blades.\" They play a genre bending blend of Funk, Bebop, Afro Beat, Avant Garde and more. Their shows have been lauded for their ability to sound like a huge band, even though they are only two musicians. For this special one off Bay Area date, they will be joined by special guests Kasey Knudsen on sax and Ryan Schaeffer on guitar. </p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a10aa042b96f93652e3ff84\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"584b0d821e5380d9c628\" id=\"block-584b0d821e5380d9c628\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-584b0d821e5380d9c628 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-584b0d821e5380d9c628 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-584b0d821e5380d9c628 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-containe",
