  {
   "id": "69fe18d7dec1e72d1031617f",
   "title": "Charles Chen Quartet",
   "startDate": 1783900800436,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/7/12/charles-chen-quartet",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>The Long Way Home</em> is pianist Charles Chen's upcoming album, recorded in New York with nonagenarians, bassist Bill Crow (98) and drummer Steve Little (91), along with guitarist Félix Lemerle. On the album, the band plays standards, and Charles interviews Bill and Steve about their legendary careers in jazz. Félix will be joining Charles this evening, as well as bassist Nico Martinez and drummer Brian Fishler.</p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69fe18d7dec1e72d1031617f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"b96969c671b27b2b8f3a\" id=\"block-b96969c671b27b2b8f3a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1778788603757_3915\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-b96969c671b27b2b8f3a {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-b96969c671b27b2b8f3a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-b96969c671b27b2b8f3a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n<",
