   "id": "69f8fef99c67f94076a34f29",
   "title": "Luther S. Allison Trio",
   "startDate": 1784421000225,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/7/18/luther-s-allison-trio",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Jazz pianist Luther S. Allison brings his trio for a debut performance at the piano store, featuring all new original works by Luther, exemplifying his compositional prowess and seamless blending of soul, swing, gospel, and the blues.&nbsp; </p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69f8fef99c67f94076a34f29\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"555185d3cd75e6e5f4dc\" id=\"block-555185d3cd75e6e5f4dc\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1777926842266_3707\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1777926842266_3706\"><strong>JAZZ PIANO MASTERS SERIES</strong></h3></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-555185d3cd75e6e5f4dc {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-555185d3cd75e6e5f4dc .sqs-html-content {\n    \n  ",
