  {
   "id": "69f2578960e5c93d6515f8b7",
   "title": "Shelly Berg",
   "startDate": 1785544200019,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/7/31/shelly-berg",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Virtuosic pianist and 5x-Grammy nominated composer and arranger Shelly Berg presents an exciting and highly informative 'History of Jazz Piano' concert that showcases and explains iconic styles such as stride, block-chord, and bebop by legendary pianists…</p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69f2578960e5c93d6515f8b7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"9c4e6515403e2424fc57\" id=\"block-9c4e6515403e2424fc57\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>JAZZ PIANO MASTERS SERIES</strong></h3></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-9c4e6515403e2424fc57 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-9c4e6515403e2424fc57 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-9c4e6515403e2424fc57 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-tex",
