  {
   "id": "69c2f9573893a17e49d72ce1",
   "title": "Cyrus Chestnut",
   "startDate": 1786235400286,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/8/8/cyrus-chestnut",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A masterful jazz pianist Cyrus Chestnut balances his lithe technical skill with a robust, soulful style that speaks to his deep gospel roots and love of swinging hard bop. Raised in the church, he learned how to infuse his swinging, classically trained style with a warm gospel sound. Every set he plays is unique, as he reads the audience and the space to create a singular musical experience.</p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69c2f9573893a17e49d72ce1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"9ee8fedcaecc26f04a25\" id=\"block-9ee8fedcaecc26f04a25\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>JAZZ PIANO MASTERS SERIES</strong></h3></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-9ee8fedcaecc26f04a25 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n--tweak-text-block-background-color: initial;\n\n  }\n\n  #block-9ee8fedcaecc26f04a25 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-b",
