  {
   "id": "6a063b0ad822af4f99e1a9c9",
   "title": "Ali Ryerson Quartet",
   "startDate": 1788654600436,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/9/5/ali-ryerson-quartet",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Internationally renowned jazz flutist Ali Ryerson celebrate the release of her latest CD,&nbsp;\"The Ali Ryerson Quartet\", recorded with Ali's east coast quartet and released on ACR Music (2026). For this special event, Ryerson will be joined&nbsp;her longtime colleagues, Steve Rudolph on piano, John Wiitala on bass, and Akira Tana on drums. The quartet comes to Oakland directly following their weeklong residency&nbsp;at Hidden Valley Music Seminars on the Monterey Peninsula, where Ryerson conducts her annual jazz flute masterclass.</p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a063b0ad822af4f99e1a9c9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"37126902dd8b4afe3d51\" id=\"block-37126902dd8b4afe3d51\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1778793227745_8831\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-37126902dd8b4afe3d51 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-37126902dd8b4afe3d51 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-37126902dd8b4afe3d51 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n<",
