  {
   "id": "6a39570dbfe0060142c90847",
   "title": "Aimee Nolte &amp; Mike Scott",
   "startDate": 1788739200619,
   "fullUrl": "/calendar/2026/9/6/aimee-nolte-mike-scott",
   "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Jazz pianist, vocalist, and educator Aimee Nolte joins acclaimed guitarist Mike Scott for an intimate evening of music featuring beloved jazz standards, original songs, and fresh interpretations of timeless classics. Blending virtuosic improvisation with heartfelt storytelling and spontaneous musical conversation, the duo creates a warm, engaging concert experience that celebrates the joy of live performance and the art of listening. Expect beautiful harmonies, inventive arrangements, and plenty of surprises. </p>",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a39570dbfe0060142c90847\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/5ca7e962-8a7d-407b-96f7-d151fc920838_722/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"6af92b7c9b4ec68f53ff\" id=\"block-6af92b7c9b4ec68f53ff\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1782155924479_4066\"><em>LIVE at Piedmont Piano Company</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-6af92b7c9b4ec68f53ff {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-6af92b7c9b4ec68f53ff .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: ",
